body:
Hi! I have a documentation issue on InstantSearch.js, I could not find what I was looking for which is: how to use the render function in the [refinementList widget](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/refinementList.html#struct-Widget)

From my understanding in the docs, this is what I should do:

```
search.addWidget(
        instantsearch.widgets.refinementList({
          container: '#tags-filter',
          attributeName: 'categories',
          render: function(foo){
            console.log(foo);
          }
        })
      );
```

However the render method is never executed.

Thank you 🙂
